# GSAP skills. The skills CLI writes real files to BOTH .agents/skills (which
# .claude/skills symlinks into, so it is the copy Claude Code resolves through)
# and agent/skills (the same content again, for other agent runtimes). We
# commit .agents/skills only. After a fresh clone, recreate the symlink layer
# with `npx skills experimental_sync`, or reinstall from skills-lock.json with
# `npx skills experimental_install`.
agent/
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json

